    "evidence": "The strongest distinctive idea is the recorded intent→cart→payment chain paired with a cyan/red semantic-divergence wedge; it makes cryptographic validity versus semantic failure visually demonstrable. However, desktop leaves much of the main canvas inert, while tablet/mobile reduce the chain to conventional stacked cards and shrink the divergence graphic until it loses impact. The surrounding dark panels, status pills, mono labels, and dense header remain familiar security-dashboard styling.",
